"id": "responsible-ai-policy",
"title": "Responsible AI Policy",
"summary": "AI-Forward's committed Responsible-AI stance. This is a **crosswalk, not a new control set**: it states the principles the pack commits to and maps each one to the **existing** persona, template, gate, or standard that already enforces it.…",
